0..80 Comment "/// This source identifies confluence certificates as paths in a presented type."
81..84 Comment "///"
85..152 Comment "/// The integer critical pair reaches one join by two certificates."
153..209 Comment "/// The presented type identifies those certificates and"
210..239 Comment "/// separates unrelated ones."
240..243 Comment "///"
244..313 Comment "/// Univalence equates certificate types with convertible boundaries."
314..378 Comment "/// A certificate consumer then crosses that equality unchanged."
